sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vue as Vue Frontend
    participant Axios as Axios Client
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Auth as JWT/RBAC
    participant Service as Business Services
    participant ML as XGBoost Prediction
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>Vue: Interact with application
    Vue->>Axios: Build API request
    Axios->>API: HTTP request + JSON
    API->>Auth: Validate JWT and permissions
    Auth-->>API: Authenticated user / role
    API->>Service: Execute requested operation
    Service->>DB: Read or update data
    DB-->>Service: Database result

    opt AI prediction required
        Service->>ML: Send prediction features
        ML-->>Service: Predicted occupancy
    end

    Service-->>API: Business result
    API-->>Axios: JSON response
    Axios-->>Vue: Parsed response
    Vue-->>User: Update interface

    Note over API,DB: Examples: reservations, parking, wallet, reviews, notifications
    Note over Service,ML: AI used for demand prediction, recommendations and dynamic pricing
